<chapter xml:id="ch-helping-researchers" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Helping Researchers Take the Next Step</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      David's planning conversation explores the difficulty of matching advice to the decision partners face now. Roger's work with students shows why understanding and responsibility must remain with the researcher. The fuller FUMA account belongs here: how data capability and planning through the federation's structures changed the basis for working together.
    </p>
  </introduction>

  <section xml:id="sec-helping-researchers-source-notes">
